{"seq":3,"slug":"protein-engineering","title":"研究生 分子生物学 — 蛋白质工程","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/natural-sciences/molecular-biology-grad/protein-science/protein-engineering","wordCount":1396,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"研究生-分子生物学-蛋白质工程\">研究生 分子生物学 — 蛋白质工程</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>蛋白质工程通过理性设计或定向进化改造蛋白质的序列，从而获得具有期望性质（更高活性、更好稳定性、新功能）的蛋白质变体。这一领域融合了结构生物学、计算生物学和高通量筛选技术，已在工业酶、治疗性抗体和生物传感器等方面产生了巨大的实际影响。2018年 Nobel 化学奖授予了定向进化（Frances Arnold）和噬菌体展示（George Smith, Gregory Winter）的开创者。</p>\n<p>核心概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>理性设计</strong>：基于结构和机制知识的定点突变</li>\n<li><strong>定向进化</strong>：模拟自然选择的实验室加速进化</li>\n<li><strong>噬菌体展示</strong>：在噬菌体表面展示蛋白质变体库并筛选</li>\n<li><strong>计算蛋白质设计</strong>：Rosetta 等工具从头设计蛋白质</li>\n<li><strong>抗体工程</strong>：人源化、亲和力成熟、双特异性抗体</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"理性设计\">理性设计</h3><p><strong>策略</strong>：基于蛋白质三维结构和催化机制的知识，预测哪些突变可以改善目标性质。</p>\n<p><strong>定点突变技术</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>PCR 引物设计引入特定碱基替换</li>\n<li>Gibson Assembly 或 Golden Gate 进行多点突变</li>\n<li>位点饱和突变：对特定位置用 NNK 密码子引入所有20种氨基酸</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>成功案例</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>枯草杆菌蛋白酶（Subtilisin）的洗涤剂耐受性改造</li>\n<li>绿色荧光蛋白（GFP）的颜色变体（CFP、YFP、mCherry）</li>\n<li>工业脂肪酶的热稳定性提升</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>局限</strong>：需要详细的结构和机制信息，对复杂性状（如异构体选择性）预测能力有限。</p>\n<h3 id=\"定向进化\">定向进化</h3><p><strong>核心流程</strong>（迭代循环）：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>多样性产生</strong>：随机突变（error-prone PCR）、DNA 重组（DNA shuffling）</li>\n<li><strong>表达与筛选/选择</strong>：高通量方法评估文库中每个变体的性状</li>\n<li><strong>扩增最优变体</strong>：作为下一轮进化的起点</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>关键技术</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>多样性类型</th>\n<th>文库大小</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Error-prone PCR</td>\n<td>点突变</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>6</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DNA shuffling</td>\n<td>重组</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>6</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>位点饱和突变</td>\n<td>定向</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt;10^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>/位点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>机器学习辅助</td>\n<td>智能采样</td>\n<td>可缩小搜索空间</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>高通量筛选方法</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>平板筛选（颜色/荧光）</li>\n<li>FACS（荧光激活细胞分选）：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>7</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^7</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>8</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">8</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>/小时</li>\n<li>微滴分选（droplet-based screening）：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>8</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">8</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>/天</li>\n<li>连续进化（PACE, Phage-Assisted Continuous Evolution）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"噬菌体展示\">噬菌体展示</h3><p><strong>原理</strong>：将蛋白质（如抗体片段 scFv）与噬菌体外壳蛋白（通常是 pIII）融合表达，在噬菌体表面展示。</p>\n<p><strong>筛选（Biopanning）</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>蛋白质文库展示在噬菌体表面</li>\n<li>与固定化的靶标结合</li>\n<li>洗脱结合的噬菌体</li>\n<li>扩增并重复 3-5 轮</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>应用</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>治疗性抗体发现</strong>：全球第一个噬菌体展示来源的药物——Adalimumab（Humira, 抗TNF-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span>）</li>\n<li><strong>肽配体筛选</strong></li>\n<li><strong>酶底物识别研究</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"计算蛋白质设计\">计算蛋白质设计</h3><p><strong>Rosetta 软件套件</strong>：基于物理化学力场的蛋白质设计平台。</p>\n<p><strong>从头设计（de novo design）</strong>：不依赖天然蛋白质模板，完全计算设计新蛋白质。</p>\n<p>里程碑成果：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Top7</strong>（2003）：第一个从头设计的稳定蛋白质折叠</li>\n<li><strong>自组装蛋白质笼</strong>：设计的蛋白质纳米颗粒用于疫苗递送</li>\n<li><strong>酶设计</strong>：设计具有非天然催化活性的人工酶</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>AI 驱动设计</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>ProteinMPNN</strong>：基于深度学习的序列设计工具</li>\n<li><strong>RFdiffusion</strong>：扩散模型生成蛋白质骨架</li>\n<li><strong>AlphaFold</strong> 辅助的设计-预测-验证循环</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"抗体工程\">抗体工程</h3><p><strong>人源化</strong>：将鼠源抗体的 CDR（互补决定区）移植到人源框架中，降低免疫原性。</p>\n<p><strong>亲和力成熟</strong>：通过 CDR 的定向进化或计算设计提高结合亲和力。</p>\n<p><strong>双特异性抗体（bispecific）</strong>：同时结合两个不同靶标的工程抗体。</p>\n<p><strong>抗体-药物偶联物（ADC）</strong>：通过化学接头将细胞毒药物连接到抗体上，实现靶向药物递送。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>比较理性设计和定向进化的优缺点，讨论它们何时应该结合使用。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>设计一个定向进化实验来提高某种酶在 60°C 下的热稳定性。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>解释为什么噬菌体展示的文库多样性通常限制在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>9</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^9</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">9</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>10</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^{10}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">10</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 范围。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>讨论 AlphaFold 和 ProteinMPNN 的结合如何改变蛋白质工程的研究范式。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>ADC 药物设计中需要优化哪些关键参数（抗体选择、接头化学、药物毒性等）？</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>Arnold (2018) Nobel 演讲 &quot;Directed Evolution: Bringing New Chemistry to Life&quot;。</li>\n<li>Huang, Boyken &amp; Baker (2016) &quot;The coming of age of de novo protein design&quot; 综述了计算设计的进展。</li>\n<li>Winter (2018) Nobel 演讲阐述了噬菌体展示在抗体药物发现中的应用。</li>\n<li>Watson et al. (2023) &quot;De novo design of protein structure and function with RFdiffusion&quot; 是 AI 蛋白质设计的最新突破。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>蛋白质工程的两大范式——理性设计和定向进化——互为补充。理性设计利用结构和计算知识进行精准改造，定向进化通过随机突变和筛选探索序列空间。噬菌体展示和 FACS 等高通量筛选技术使得大规模文库的探索成为可能。计算蛋白质设计（Rosetta + AI）正在开启从头设计功能蛋白质的新时代。抗体工程作为蛋白质工程最成功的应用领域，已经产生了数十个上市药物并持续推动精准医学的发展。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"研究生 分子生物学 — 蛋白质工程","id":"研究生-分子生物学-蛋白质工程"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"理性设计","id":"理性设计"},{"level":3,"text":"定向进化","id":"定向进化"},{"level":3,"text":"噬菌体展示","id":"噬菌体展示"},{"level":3,"text":"计算蛋白质设计","id":"计算蛋白质设计"},{"level":3,"text":"抗体工程","id":"抗体工程"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"研究生 分子生物学 — 蛋白质组学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/natural-sciences/molecular-biology-grad/protein-science/proteomics"},"next":{"title":"研究生 分子生物学 — 信号转导通路","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/natural-sciences/molecular-biology-grad/cell-signaling/signal-transduction-pathways"}}